OL,3,GNEWSAParty leaders remember the war
OL,4,Adead ahead of Remembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FEach party leader offers their
OL,7,Fcommemorations ahead of Remembrance
OL,8,FSunday
OL,10,FScottish Labour leader Michael Marra
OL,11,Fuses his allotted time to criticise
OL,12,FJohn Swinney's government for not
OL,13,Fsupporting jobs. He asks the FM how he
OL,14,Fis going to grow the country.
OL,16,FThe First Minister says he has pressed
OL,17,FUK PM Andy Burnham to change current
OL,18,Flaws as they do not give "us enough
OL,19,Fscope to invest"
