OL,3,GNEWSAParty leaders remember the war
OL,4,Adead ahead of Remembrance Sunday
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's Reform leader Malcolm Offord
OL,7,Fraises North Sea oil investment and
OL,8,Faccuses Swinney of "giving up on
OL,9,FAberdeen and Scotland"
OL,11,FThe FM says he would like to see a
OL,12,Fgreater pace in renewables in the north
OL,13,Fof the country, but that is being
OL,14,Fhampered by the UK government's poor
OL,15,Fapproach to grid connections
